WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

00:46.540 --> 00:47.620
[Memorial Tablet of Sun Li, a Beloved Son]

00:49.380 --> 00:50.040
Is this

00:50.940 --> 00:51.850
the widow burning?

00:54.480 --> 00:55.360
I quit!

00:55.700 --> 00:57.380
I'm out! I'm out!

00:57.420 --> 00:58.560
I'm not playing this!

00:58.700 --> 01:00.220
I… I quit.

01:00.620 --> 01:01.620
Let go of me!

01:02.490 --> 01:03.940
Please let me go!

01:04.010 --> 01:05.720
Hot! Hot! Hot!

01:08.900 --> 01:10.330
I quit!

01:16.120 --> 01:16.990
[Game Over]

01:20.650 --> 01:21.900
It's supposed to be a farming game.

01:22.300 --> 01:23.130
I didn't see any farm

01:23.740 --> 01:24.870
and was hunted once I entered it.

01:25.050 --> 01:25.990
I was almost burned alive!

01:26.380 --> 01:28.090
There was a problem with the system just now.

01:28.460 --> 01:29.510
You were dropped

01:29.539 --> 01:30.260
at the wrong time.

01:30.660 --> 01:31.670
Fix the bugs.

01:32.259 --> 01:32.820
Okay.

01:33.020 --> 01:33.660
Let's try again.

01:33.979 --> 01:35.170
Calm down.

01:37.259 --> 01:37.830
Let me tell you.

01:38.380 --> 01:39.460
As one of the first beta testers

01:39.479 --> 01:40.390
of this game,

01:40.820 --> 01:41.860
after completing the missions,

01:41.900 --> 01:42.870
you can not only get a bonus

01:42.900 --> 01:44.620
but also make contributions to the development of the game.

01:45.060 --> 01:45.700
Once the game started,

01:46.259 --> 01:47.570
I kicked the bucket.

01:48.280 --> 01:49.220
I don't think

01:49.259 --> 01:50.120
I'm a tester.

01:50.820 --> 01:51.820
I'm a victim.

01:53.180 --> 01:54.100
If I try again,

01:54.259 --> 01:55.160
can you

01:55.729 --> 01:56.250
make it

01:56.740 --> 01:57.539
a little bit less painful?

01:58.100 --> 01:58.660
No problem.

01:59.300 --> 02:00.460
But I have to remind you

02:00.980 --> 02:02.250
that you still have to

02:02.500 --> 02:03.720
deal with those annoying relatives.

02:04.380 --> 02:05.100
Therefore,

02:05.340 --> 02:06.980
after you get a mission in the game…

02:09.289 --> 02:10.350
You've said it fifty times.

02:11.490 --> 02:12.060
Grandpa,

02:12.260 --> 02:13.860
your grandson is calling.

02:14.380 --> 02:16.900
-I need to take this call.
-Grandpa, your grandson is calling.

02:18.100 --> 02:19.500
You called me so many times.

02:19.520 --> 02:20.600
What's so urgent?

02:20.980 --> 02:21.380
Mom.

02:21.820 --> 02:23.540
School is about to start. My tuition…

02:23.980 --> 02:25.420
Why don't you ask your dad for it?

02:26.060 --> 02:27.100
He said he's cash-strapped

02:27.150 --> 02:27.790
and asked me to turn to you.

02:28.700 --> 02:29.860
Your sister's piano lessons

02:29.860 --> 02:31.220
have cost me a lot of money.

02:31.520 --> 02:33.240
Li is not in good health.

02:33.700 --> 02:35.140
His tonics and medicines

02:35.320 --> 02:36.380
are all very expensive.

02:36.980 --> 02:38.190
Since your dad and I got divorced,

02:38.329 --> 02:39.430
I've been providing for you.

02:39.700 --> 02:40.579
I've done my best.

02:41.660 --> 02:42.420
Call your dad.

02:42.700 --> 02:43.579
Ask him for the money.

02:44.260 --> 02:45.220
You're a sophomore now.

02:45.820 --> 02:46.820
He just needs to pay your tuition

02:46.820 --> 02:47.660
for another two years.

02:48.140 --> 02:49.500
Tell him not to be so stingy.

02:49.800 --> 02:51.180
But Mom, I…

02:54.329 --> 02:55.430
[Mom]

03:16.480 --> 03:22.370
[Romance on the Farm]

03:22.750 --> 03:24.720
[Episode 1]

03:24.870 --> 03:27.450
[Loading]

03:45.270 --> 03:46.660
[New location unlocked]

03:45.270 --> 03:46.660
[Shisanli Camp]

04:14.980 --> 04:16.100
[Flower, a pig]

04:17.459 --> 04:18.579
Hello, piggy.

04:27.140 --> 04:27.780
Lian Man'er?

04:28.890 --> 04:31.020
Your grandma sent you to work in the fields.

04:31.340 --> 04:32.620
How dare you slack off here?

04:34.670 --> 04:36.520
[Father's younger sister, Lian Xiu'er]

04:36.700 --> 04:37.700
Xiu'er?

04:39.700 --> 04:41.430
Who would slack off in a pigsty?

04:43.580 --> 04:44.220
Stay away from me.

04:47.460 --> 04:48.780
What a pretentious NPC.

05:00.750 --> 05:01.600
[Younger brother, Seven]

05:01.260 --> 05:01.820
Man'er.

05:08.570 --> 05:09.940
It feels so real.

05:16.800 --> 05:17.760
You're so cute.

05:34.320 --> 05:35.590
[Yellow, a big yellow dog]

05:43.810 --> 05:46.020
[Uncle Shouyi's daughter, Lian Ye'er]

05:51.200 --> 05:53.900
[Uncle Shouyi's wife, He]

05:52.020 --> 05:54.460
Watch where you throw the water.

05:56.590 --> 05:57.350
He.

05:58.340 --> 05:59.460
Did you steal the eggs?

05:59.780 --> 06:00.460
Mother.

06:00.780 --> 06:02.140
Don't blame me for things I didn't do.

06:01.920 --> 06:03.730
[Grandma, Zhou]

06:02.310 --> 06:04.200
I've been working the whole morning.

06:04.380 --> 06:06.460
I was too busy to steal your precious eggs.

06:07.210 --> 06:08.220
Ye'er.

06:08.580 --> 06:09.140
Ye'er.

06:09.580 --> 06:10.380
Come and give me a hand.

06:10.990 --> 06:11.490
Sweep the floor.

06:11.510 --> 06:12.080
Why does the old lady

06:12.110 --> 06:13.220
keep her hand on the hen's butt?

06:13.980 --> 06:15.230
That's how she knows

06:15.350 --> 06:16.190
how many eggs the hen will lay.

06:16.220 --> 06:17.020
What are you talking about?

06:17.660 --> 06:18.670
You're good for nothing

06:18.900 --> 06:20.020
but eat everything!

06:20.140 --> 06:21.580
Go to work!

06:21.780 --> 06:22.780
Stop idling around.

06:23.820 --> 06:24.700
Why are you still standing there?

06:25.780 --> 06:27.270
You lazy bum.

06:27.460 --> 06:28.460
You need a lesson.

06:31.600 --> 06:32.520
Don't run!

06:32.680 --> 06:33.790
Why are you hitting me?

06:33.820 --> 06:34.870
Go cook.

06:34.900 --> 06:36.100
Mother.

06:36.440 --> 06:37.650
[Mother, Zhang]

06:37.780 --> 06:38.670
Zhang.

06:37.830 --> 06:39.180
[Unborn brother, Eight]

06:39.380 --> 06:40.330
Did you

06:40.780 --> 06:42.000
steal my egg?

06:42.659 --> 06:43.230
Mother.

06:43.820 --> 06:44.700
What are you talking about?

06:45.900 --> 06:47.630
I keep an eye on the hen every day.

06:47.659 --> 06:48.750
I touched its butt this morning.

06:48.780 --> 06:50.100
There should be five eggs

06:50.140 --> 06:51.820
but I only found four.

06:52.020 --> 06:52.830
Someone must

06:52.850 --> 06:53.840
have stolen one.

06:54.820 --> 06:55.530
Say something.

06:56.860 --> 06:57.530
Mother.

06:58.260 --> 06:59.520
Shouxin, I didn't steal any eggs.

06:59.710 --> 07:01.580
Mother, what happened?

06:59.900 --> 07:01.730
[Father, Lian Shouxin]

07:02.020 --> 07:03.140
You're back at a good time.

07:03.540 --> 07:05.480
Your wife is so hot-tempered.

07:05.660 --> 07:07.020
She gave me attitude just because I asked her a few questions.

07:07.020 --> 07:08.060
Look at her.

07:08.780 --> 07:09.460
Mother.

07:09.700 --> 07:11.740
We've been living together for so many years.

07:12.330 --> 07:14.010
You should know very clearly

07:14.140 --> 07:14.980
that your daughter-in-law

07:15.000 --> 07:16.080
is not a thief.

07:17.900 --> 07:20.970
What a good son I raised!

07:21.000 --> 07:22.760
To defend your wife,

07:23.040 --> 07:25.570
you actually called me an old bat!

07:26.260 --> 07:28.140
How could you be so harsh?

07:28.630 --> 07:30.470
I raised you!

07:30.780 --> 07:32.860
What did I do to deserve this?

07:33.170 --> 07:35.860
You don't even respect your mother!

07:35.900 --> 07:36.460
Mother.

07:36.820 --> 07:37.700
It's all my fault.

07:37.960 --> 07:39.420
Zhang.

07:39.980 --> 07:41.640
Eating an egg is not a crime.

07:41.659 --> 07:42.860
Just admit it.

07:43.100 --> 07:45.100
Mother will just give you a piece of her mind.

07:46.060 --> 07:47.950
He, I...

07:47.970 --> 07:48.640
Yes.

07:49.550 --> 07:50.590
It's just eating an egg.

07:50.810 --> 07:51.600
Just admit it.

07:52.300 --> 07:52.900
Admit it.

07:53.460 --> 07:54.130
Aunt He.

08:03.570 --> 08:04.560
Good for you.

08:04.680 --> 08:05.510
Mother.

08:06.580 --> 08:07.100
Mother!

08:07.500 --> 08:08.580
Listen to me, Mother.

08:08.580 --> 08:10.340
Stop right there!

08:12.830 --> 08:14.080
-Mother!
-Stop!

09:39.660 --> 09:40.780
It does hurt.

09:53.700 --> 09:55.700
What kind of family is the Lian family?

09:59.820 --> 10:00.610
I've been here for so long

10:01.820 --> 10:03.060
but still haven't received any mission.

10:49.220 --> 10:50.580
What a beautiful view!

10:50.950 --> 10:52.020
It's a pity that I can't take a picture

10:52.050 --> 10:52.820
and update it online.

11:07.330 --> 11:10.950
[New Mission]

11:07.330 --> 11:10.950
[Earn 1,000 taels of gold]

11:10.980 --> 11:14.060
Earn 1,000 taels of gold.

11:16.450 --> 11:17.220
Is it hard or easy?

11:17.820 --> 11:18.280
Man'er.

11:20.700 --> 11:21.850
Go home now,

11:22.210 --> 11:22.980
or Grandma will scold you,

11:23.290 --> 11:24.820
Scold me all she wants. I don't care.

11:25.820 --> 11:26.690
A box?

11:28.740 --> 11:30.250
Can you see the words inside?

11:33.020 --> 11:33.570
So it's only visible

11:33.590 --> 11:34.590
to me.

11:36.700 --> 11:37.720
Seven, let me ask you.

11:38.140 --> 11:39.070
How much

11:39.100 --> 11:39.980
is a cucumber here?

11:40.500 --> 11:42.260
Cucumber? I don't know.

11:42.580 --> 11:43.360
But I know

11:43.460 --> 11:44.860
toffee apples are five coins each.

11:45.360 --> 11:46.510
That means

11:46.540 --> 11:47.700
one coin in this world

11:47.720 --> 11:49.320
equals one yuan in the real world.

11:49.790 --> 11:51.500
1,000 taels of gold

11:51.540 --> 11:52.910
equals 10,000 taels of silver.

11:52.940 --> 11:54.220
One tael of silver is worth 1,000 coins.

11:58.870 --> 12:00.710
That means 10 million yuan.

12:02.340 --> 12:03.340
10 million yuan?

12:04.900 --> 12:06.100
I'm wearing patched clothes.

12:06.120 --> 12:06.950
How can I possibly

12:06.980 --> 12:08.060
make 10 million yuan?

12:10.180 --> 12:11.420
It's 10 million!

12:12.300 --> 12:13.300
10 million.

12:14.300 --> 12:15.490
It's an impossible mission.

12:16.100 --> 12:16.700
Man'er.

12:17.500 --> 12:18.500
Are you okay?

12:19.680 --> 12:20.600
10 million.

12:32.820 --> 12:33.340
Ye'er.

12:33.970 --> 12:35.070
Do you know

12:35.210 --> 12:37.220
how to earn 1,000 taels of gold?

12:38.100 --> 12:38.980
1,000 taels of gold?

12:39.980 --> 12:40.740
Are you crazy?

12:41.330 --> 12:42.170
Let alone earn it,

12:42.620 --> 12:43.840
we can't even see so much money

12:43.880 --> 12:45.510
in our whole life.

12:48.580 --> 12:50.470
How many acres of land do we have?

12:51.370 --> 12:52.500
35 acres.

12:54.890 --> 12:55.750
35 acres?

12:56.360 --> 12:57.600
Logically speaking,

12:58.290 --> 13:00.160
the crops we can harvest every year

13:00.180 --> 13:01.190
are worth a lot.

13:01.410 --> 13:02.710
Why are we still so poor?

13:03.860 --> 13:05.570
Don't you know our situation?

13:10.320 --> 13:11.820
Uncle Shouren is a scholar.

13:12.350 --> 13:15.040
Grandpa and Grandma hope he can become a dignitary.

13:15.420 --> 13:16.450
Once he does,

13:16.480 --> 13:18.580
the whole Lian family can live a better life.

13:20.500 --> 13:21.640
So over the years,

13:21.660 --> 13:23.090
all the money we earned

13:23.300 --> 13:24.700
has been sent to Uncle Shouren.

13:25.260 --> 13:26.970
After all, he and his family live in town.

13:26.990 --> 13:27.950
Everything there is expensive.

13:28.340 --> 13:29.950
Peasants like us

13:29.970 --> 13:31.790
can never enjoy that kind of life.

13:32.350 --> 13:33.960
Besides, the government

13:33.980 --> 13:36.320
is collecting more and more taxes.

13:36.770 --> 13:38.300
We just paid the land tax.

13:39.040 --> 13:40.480
Money is very tight now.

13:49.140 --> 13:50.550
Grandma is opening the cabinet!

13:52.500 --> 13:53.060
What's wrong?

13:53.630 --> 13:54.670
Only when Uncle Shouren

13:54.700 --> 13:55.520
comes back from town

13:55.820 --> 13:57.060
does Grandma open the cabinet.

13:58.220 --> 13:58.980
Are there treasures in it?

14:09.100 --> 14:09.740
Ye'er.

14:09.900 --> 14:11.980
Hurry up. I'm hungry.

14:35.610 --> 14:36.450
Pork belly?

14:38.360 --> 14:40.630
Pork belly is the most delicious.

14:47.620 --> 14:48.150
One.

14:50.380 --> 14:51.420
Two.

14:53.550 --> 14:54.670
Three.

14:56.700 --> 14:57.460
Four.

14:59.460 --> 15:00.180
Five.

15:00.710 --> 15:02.750
We only got four slices for the Spring Festival.

15:03.380 --> 15:04.440
That's the sixth slice!

15:07.620 --> 15:08.130
Seven.

15:12.520 --> 15:13.290
Eight!

15:25.840 --> 15:28.100
[Shisanli Camp]

15:40.100 --> 15:41.100
We're almost there.

15:44.230 --> 15:46.410
[Uncle Shouren's daughter,  Lian Hua'er]

15:48.220 --> 15:48.820
Mother.

15:49.820 --> 15:50.580
The match

15:50.610 --> 15:51.650
we made for Man'er,

15:52.040 --> 15:53.290
will she agree to it?

15:53.980 --> 15:55.420
After all, that man is…

15:55.630 --> 15:57.120
Don't worry.

15:57.520 --> 15:58.530
Your Grandpa, Grandma,

15:57.680 --> 15:59.710
[Uncle Shouren's wife, Gu]

15:58.880 --> 16:00.160
Uncle Shouxin, and Aunt Zhang

16:00.580 --> 16:01.700
have all agreed to marry Man'er

16:01.890 --> 16:03.210
to that man.

16:07.180 --> 16:08.050
Shouren.

16:09.420 --> 16:10.180
Shouren?

16:12.190 --> 16:13.030
What do you think?

16:15.170 --> 16:17.820
[Father's oldest brother, Lian Shouren]

16:16.580 --> 16:17.550
If

16:18.460 --> 16:20.500
she were your slick second uncle's daughter,

16:21.100 --> 16:22.820
things might not go smoothly.

16:24.100 --> 16:24.860
Your third uncle and his wife

16:25.580 --> 16:26.420
are simple people.

16:27.580 --> 16:28.460
They won't have objections.

16:30.940 --> 16:33.100
You've heard what your father said.

16:33.650 --> 16:34.490
Tomorrow,

16:34.840 --> 16:36.480
once the matchmaker takes her away,

16:36.930 --> 16:38.300
the 500 taels of silver

16:39.060 --> 16:40.140
will be ours.

16:42.500 --> 16:43.460
I made this deal

16:43.940 --> 16:44.990
for the Lian family.

16:46.980 --> 16:47.740
As long as

16:48.500 --> 16:49.510
Hua'er can successfully

16:49.530 --> 16:50.170
marry up,

16:51.100 --> 16:52.170
I can buy a position.

16:52.650 --> 16:54.170
The day I take office,

16:54.530 --> 16:55.650
the Lian family's miserable life

16:55.890 --> 16:56.730
will come to an end.

16:58.220 --> 16:58.740
Yes.

16:59.300 --> 17:00.140
Remember.

17:00.700 --> 17:01.780
My parents must not

17:02.500 --> 17:03.860
know about this.

17:04.700 --> 17:05.780
Father, look.

17:05.010 --> 17:07.109
[White Pear]

17:06.140 --> 17:08.140
This is top-notch wine.

17:08.380 --> 17:09.420
It's called White Pear.

17:10.280 --> 17:12.410
[Grandpa, Lian Fang]

17:10.609 --> 17:12.130
This is better.

17:12.460 --> 17:13.700
They are first-class desserts.

17:13.750 --> 17:15.040
They're called One Bite Cookies.

17:15.700 --> 17:16.900
Dignitaries

17:17.089 --> 17:18.609
love them.

17:19.030 --> 17:20.510
Try them later.

17:22.700 --> 17:24.220
My goodness.

17:24.220 --> 17:25.780
We're already very glad that you're back.

17:26.060 --> 17:27.460
You don't need to bring any gifts.

17:27.980 --> 17:29.290
They must have cost you lots of money.

17:29.490 --> 17:30.380
They didn't cost a penny.

17:30.610 --> 17:31.580
Really?

17:30.980 --> 17:33.050
[Father's second oldest brother, Lian Shouyi]

17:32.500 --> 17:33.980
Someone gave them to you as gifts?

17:34.740 --> 17:35.980
These years, I've been down on my luck

17:36.710 --> 17:38.550
and failed many exams.

17:38.860 --> 17:39.380
But

17:39.480 --> 17:41.360
it's undeniable that I'm erudite.

17:41.620 --> 17:42.720
While I prepare for the exams,

17:42.890 --> 17:44.020
I teach students

17:44.260 --> 17:45.220
in a private school.

17:45.580 --> 17:46.710
My students

17:47.180 --> 17:48.660
all admire me very much.

17:49.660 --> 17:50.180
Father.

17:51.700 --> 17:52.900
Have you been busy recently?

17:54.420 --> 17:56.500
No. Not much work in the fields now.

17:57.720 --> 18:00.810
I'll be busy when the autumn harvest starts.

18:02.420 --> 18:02.970
Father.

18:03.420 --> 18:04.560
I've put the firewood in the backyard.

18:05.700 --> 18:06.630
Stop chatting here.

18:06.660 --> 18:07.620
Dinner is ready.

18:08.010 --> 18:08.750
Okay. Let's eat.

18:08.780 --> 18:09.620
Okay.

18:09.710 --> 18:10.100
Here.

18:10.810 --> 18:12.040
Let's eat.

18:13.940 --> 18:14.500
Here.

18:14.980 --> 18:16.460
Fill the glass.

18:19.640 --> 18:21.230
Shouren, eat more.

18:22.060 --> 18:22.660
Alright.

18:51.220 --> 18:51.700
Fill the glass.

18:52.180 --> 18:52.740
Xiu'er.

18:53.420 --> 18:54.420
You look

18:54.460 --> 18:55.180
so beautiful

18:55.610 --> 18:56.650
with that gold-plated hairpin.

18:57.570 --> 18:58.530
Hua'er wouldn't wear

18:58.620 --> 19:00.050
this hairpin.

19:00.110 --> 19:01.490
She wanted to save it for you.

19:02.580 --> 19:03.700
Here, Hua'er.

19:04.210 --> 19:06.090
The meat is delicious. Have some more.

19:39.000 --> 19:39.680
Have some meat.

19:50.220 --> 19:50.980
How dare you!

19:51.890 --> 19:53.370
What's in your mouth?

19:54.820 --> 19:55.420
Meat.

19:56.800 --> 19:57.580
Look.

19:57.610 --> 19:58.890
Look at your good daughter.

19:59.500 --> 20:00.620
She's a glutton!

20:01.540 --> 20:02.970
You keep eating the meat.

20:03.700 --> 20:04.700
Don't think I can't see through

20:04.700 --> 20:06.460
what you're thinking.

20:06.740 --> 20:08.140
I can get meat for myself.

20:08.380 --> 20:09.230
Shut up!

20:09.640 --> 20:10.460
Shouren seldom

20:10.480 --> 20:11.100
comes back.

20:11.120 --> 20:12.410
Just let children have the meat.

20:13.400 --> 20:14.050
I haven't even

20:14.150 --> 20:15.940
had one bite of the meat!

20:16.460 --> 20:17.250
Man'er,

20:17.270 --> 20:18.660
you're so shameless!

20:20.300 --> 20:21.230
Both of them ate it.

20:21.780 --> 20:22.700
Why couldn't I?

20:23.460 --> 20:24.480
I gave the meat to Hua'er.

20:24.700 --> 20:25.610
What did you do to deserve meat?

20:27.210 --> 20:28.980
I washed seven eggplants,

20:29.300 --> 20:30.020
eight cabbages,

20:30.180 --> 20:31.220
and 29 string beans

20:31.620 --> 20:32.280
I earned it.

20:32.730 --> 20:34.940
You dumb girl.

20:35.490 --> 20:37.030
Are you so arrogant

20:37.060 --> 20:38.460
because you're going to marry a rich man?

20:38.700 --> 20:39.860
How dare you talk back

20:39.860 --> 20:41.060
to your elders again and again?

20:41.350 --> 20:42.900
This is the daughter you raised!

20:44.690 --> 20:45.650
I'm getting married?

20:47.940 --> 20:48.700
Man'er.

20:49.460 --> 20:50.140
Think about it.

20:50.740 --> 20:51.810
You're about

20:51.840 --> 20:53.280
to marry the son of the Sun family.

20:53.500 --> 20:55.020
In the future,

20:55.060 --> 20:56.110
you'll be showered

20:56.130 --> 20:56.980
with riches.

20:57.460 --> 20:58.720
Why do you have to

20:58.740 --> 20:59.750
fight with your grandma

21:00.220 --> 21:01.480
over a piece of meat?

21:01.620 --> 21:02.220
Yeah.

21:03.540 --> 21:04.460
The Sun family?

21:07.050 --> 21:09.760
[Memorial Tablet of Sun Li, a Beloved Son]

21:11.700 --> 21:12.660
Which Sun family?

21:14.380 --> 21:14.900
Sun Li?

21:15.460 --> 21:15.980
Yes.

21:16.320 --> 21:17.220
As we all know,

21:17.420 --> 21:18.480
the Sun family is one of

21:18.500 --> 21:19.420
the richest families here.

21:20.220 --> 21:20.860
Man'er.

21:21.220 --> 21:22.370
Your life

21:22.620 --> 21:23.540
is going to be better and better.

21:25.700 --> 21:27.090
Not the Sun family again.

21:27.780 --> 21:29.660
If I marry into it, I'll probably be burned alive again.

21:31.630 --> 21:32.380
I refuse!

21:36.460 --> 21:37.020
Nonsense!

21:37.540 --> 21:38.660
Marriage is serious.

21:39.140 --> 21:39.930
The decision

21:40.540 --> 21:43.140
is not yours to make!

21:43.660 --> 21:45.450
I'm getting married, not you.

21:46.140 --> 21:47.260
Why can't I make the decision?

21:48.220 --> 21:48.910
Brother.

21:49.340 --> 21:50.120
I pulled strings

21:50.140 --> 21:51.180
to make this match.

21:51.530 --> 21:53.300
It's a favor to me!

21:53.940 --> 21:55.620
The Sun family is not just any family.

21:55.940 --> 21:57.180
It's such a good match.

21:57.530 --> 21:58.760
Back then, Father, Mother,

21:58.980 --> 21:59.980
and you two

22:00.460 --> 22:01.540
all gave the nod.

22:01.940 --> 22:02.420
Tomorrow,

22:02.780 --> 22:03.930
the matchmaker will come to pick her up.

22:04.630 --> 22:05.620
If I go back on my word,

22:05.940 --> 22:07.590
how can I face the Sun family again?

22:07.610 --> 22:09.400
Do you want me to lose face?

22:10.860 --> 22:12.460
Young Master Sun is young and rich.

22:12.700 --> 22:14.700
Why is he in such a hurry

22:14.740 --> 22:16.420
to marry a country girl like me?

22:18.310 --> 22:19.260
Who knows

22:19.300 --> 22:19.980
what he's up to?

22:20.420 --> 22:20.980
Maybe

22:21.740 --> 22:22.780
I'd be burned as his widow.

22:24.660 --> 22:25.420
Man'er.

22:26.160 --> 22:28.040
You can't talk to Uncle Shouren like that.

22:30.260 --> 22:30.980
Man'er.

22:31.500 --> 22:33.140
You're overthinking.

22:33.460 --> 22:35.300
The Sun family has chosen you

22:35.560 --> 22:36.840
because you're lucky.

22:37.280 --> 22:38.920
The fortune teller said

22:38.940 --> 22:40.460
you're a good match for Young Master Sun.

22:41.380 --> 22:42.380
As a girl,

22:42.540 --> 22:44.260
you'll get married sooner or later.

22:44.810 --> 22:46.180
Marrying into the Sun family

22:46.500 --> 22:48.510
is what every girl dreams of.

22:48.710 --> 22:50.050
-Yeah.
-It'd be a pity if you missed your chance.

22:50.180 --> 22:51.060
Aunt Gu.

22:51.940 --> 22:52.780
If it's really as great as you said,

22:53.380 --> 22:54.700
you should let Hua'er be the bride.

22:54.880 --> 22:55.330
You…

22:57.050 --> 22:58.760
That's nonsense.

22:59.220 --> 23:00.140
Hua'er

23:00.450 --> 23:02.180
is engaged to the son of the Song family.

23:02.660 --> 23:03.980
Without your uncle,

23:04.740 --> 23:05.660
such a good thing

23:05.770 --> 23:07.330
would never happen to you!

23:08.420 --> 23:09.940
The Sun family is so rich.

23:10.260 --> 23:11.940
You can't ask for more!

23:12.220 --> 23:13.060
Do you expect

23:13.150 --> 23:14.710
to marry into the royal family?

23:15.700 --> 23:17.380
How ungrateful you are!

23:18.660 --> 23:19.220
Shouxin, He.

23:19.870 --> 23:21.380
What do you two think?

23:24.750 --> 23:27.110
We've given consent to this marriage,

23:27.590 --> 23:28.850
but since Man'er is strongly against it,,

23:29.460 --> 23:30.980
I don't think we should force her.

23:32.900 --> 23:33.990
Luckily, the Sun family

23:34.260 --> 23:35.480
hasn't taken Man'er away.

23:36.340 --> 23:37.710
Given the Sun family's influence,

23:38.170 --> 23:39.470
it won't be hard for them

23:39.740 --> 23:40.700
to find another good match.

23:41.590 --> 23:42.110
Brother.

23:45.180 --> 23:45.780
Mother.

23:46.940 --> 23:47.620
Mother.

23:49.540 --> 23:52.460
What's wrong with you guys?

23:52.890 --> 23:53.530
Why do you

23:53.550 --> 23:55.540
have to give up

23:55.620 --> 23:57.500
the beautiful life at hand?

23:57.980 --> 24:00.140
Shouren made the match

24:00.160 --> 24:02.120
for your good!

24:02.700 --> 24:03.460
How could you

24:03.500 --> 24:05.090
turn him down like this?

24:05.530 --> 24:08.310
You ingrate!

24:09.940 --> 24:10.460
Mother.

24:10.540 --> 24:10.980
Mother!

24:11.000 --> 24:11.410
Mother!

24:12.010 --> 24:12.610
Mother!

24:12.970 --> 24:13.810
Look.

24:14.220 --> 24:15.060
It's a great thing.

24:15.380 --> 24:16.610
Can't you just say yes?

24:16.640 --> 24:18.000
Look how angry you've made Mother!

24:24.640 --> 24:26.470
I'm not getting married!

24:26.500 --> 24:28.690
I'll in no way get married!

24:29.230 --> 24:30.390
If you force me again,

24:30.580 --> 24:32.510
I'll jump into the well.

24:32.540 --> 24:33.670
I'm not getting married!

24:33.700 --> 24:35.750
Jump! Don't stop her.

24:35.960 --> 24:37.600
Man'er doesn't want to get married.

24:37.860 --> 24:39.260
Grandma is pushing her too hard.

24:39.690 --> 24:40.730
This is too much.

24:41.430 --> 24:42.600
Beast!

24:42.970 --> 24:45.110
Jump into the well or get married!

24:45.580 --> 24:47.130
How dare you threaten me?

24:51.860 --> 24:52.300
Fine.

24:52.900 --> 24:53.730
I'm going to tell everyone

24:54.220 --> 24:55.270
that the Lian family

24:55.300 --> 24:56.820
forces their daughter into marriage for money.

24:57.340 --> 24:58.420
Let's see what people will think!

24:59.350 --> 25:00.190
Stop her!

25:00.290 --> 25:01.970
I'll cook meat for whoever stops her!

25:03.680 --> 25:04.640
I can stop her!

25:09.610 --> 25:11.010
Man'er, don't do anything stupid.

25:11.090 --> 25:11.700
Girl.

25:11.830 --> 25:12.690
Stay back!

25:12.980 --> 25:13.780
If you come closer, I'll jump off.

25:13.890 --> 25:14.540
Stay back.

25:14.540 --> 25:15.220
I want to eat meat.

25:15.380 --> 25:16.060
S-Stay back.

25:16.160 --> 25:16.690
Come over.

25:17.140 --> 25:18.380
Man'er, don't jump!

25:21.880 --> 25:22.660
Stay away!

25:24.500 --> 25:25.260
Man'er.

25:26.940 --> 25:28.180
Why am I so unlucky?

25:28.700 --> 25:29.860
I was burned to death last time.

25:30.080 --> 25:32.640
I don't think being drowned is any better.

25:34.010 --> 25:34.690
Man'er.

25:43.450 --> 25:44.050
Man'er!

25:44.740 --> 25:45.420
Man'er.

25:47.380 --> 25:48.020
Man'er!

25:53.230 --> 25:55.150
Hold on to me!

25:55.180 --> 25:56.180
Hold on.

25:57.220 --> 25:58.080
Man'er.

26:13.730 --> 26:14.620
Man'er.

26:15.460 --> 26:17.750
Man'er. Man'er.

26:18.980 --> 26:19.740
Man'er.

26:25.260 --> 26:26.100
Man'er.

26:30.490 --> 26:32.620
Don't do something so stupid again.

26:51.660 --> 26:52.140
Mother.

26:54.460 --> 26:55.180
What do you think

26:55.180 --> 26:56.440
made Man'er change her mind?

26:59.130 --> 26:59.920
Don't worry.

27:00.700 --> 27:02.140
Nothing will go wrong.

27:02.540 --> 27:03.660
After the matchmaker comes tomorrow

27:03.860 --> 27:04.850
and takes her away,

27:05.410 --> 27:07.500
it'll be a done deal.

27:11.850 --> 27:12.620
Mother, I'm confused.

27:13.300 --> 27:14.090
How did Man'er know

27:14.110 --> 27:15.100
that after she marries into the Sun family…

27:20.120 --> 27:21.940
No! I'm not going in there!

27:21.940 --> 27:22.660
Get in!

27:22.660 --> 27:23.500
No!

27:23.540 --> 27:23.920
Get in!

27:23.950 --> 27:24.860
No.

27:27.740 --> 27:28.310
Stay here.

27:31.540 --> 27:32.700
Let me out!

27:33.180 --> 27:34.260
Let me out!

27:52.920 --> 27:55.110
You want me to die? No way!

27:57.050 --> 27:58.130
If anyone dares force me again,

27:59.040 --> 28:01.030
I'll throw ginger juice at their face!

28:06.290 --> 28:06.760
Who's it?

28:11.010 --> 28:11.690
Who's it?

28:24.820 --> 28:25.620
Seven?

28:33.270 --> 28:34.700
Amazing. I'm impressed.

28:35.100 --> 28:36.450
Man'er, come with me.

28:37.140 --> 28:37.540
What?

28:37.780 --> 28:38.380
You don't have to get married.

28:38.410 --> 28:39.920
I'll protect you from now on.

28:42.000 --> 28:42.560
So cute.

28:46.820 --> 28:47.410
Let's go.

28:56.320 --> 28:57.040
Man'er.

29:00.060 --> 29:00.700
Man'er.

29:02.460 --> 29:02.940
Man'er,

29:03.460 --> 29:04.020
Seven.

29:04.660 --> 29:05.740
Why are you hiding here?

29:06.880 --> 29:08.400
He sawed off the wooden bar.

29:11.160 --> 29:11.690
Man'er.

29:12.500 --> 29:13.460
I've packed your things.

29:13.860 --> 29:15.340
Go hide in my brother's place for a few days.

29:16.190 --> 29:16.740
Go.

29:24.540 --> 29:25.300
I'm useless.

29:26.250 --> 29:27.500
I failed to protect you.

29:28.460 --> 29:29.220
All these years,

29:29.860 --> 29:31.740
I've been sucking it up in this family.

29:32.320 --> 29:34.200
But this marriage

29:34.740 --> 29:36.270
concerns your happiness.

29:37.300 --> 29:39.020
I can't sit by anymore.

29:41.390 --> 29:42.110
Go.

29:42.940 --> 29:43.460
Hurry.

29:44.180 --> 29:44.660
Go.

29:55.060 --> 29:56.210
If Grandma finds out,

29:57.360 --> 29:58.670
tell her I ran away myself.

30:02.560 --> 30:03.550
Stay safe.

30:08.710 --> 30:12.300
♫We met above the clouds♫

30:12.620 --> 30:15.900
♫It's a dream come true♫

30:17.000 --> 30:20.020
♫A wisp of smoke♫

30:25.370 --> 30:28.220
♫A passing thought♫

30:26.860 --> 30:28.300
What's the point of creating

30:28.840 --> 30:30.630
so many difficult relatives in a farming game?

30:30.950 --> 30:37.880
♫Always on my mind♫

30:31.780 --> 30:33.060
The developer must be insane.

30:34.300 --> 30:35.420
I'm sent to find my uncle,

30:35.940 --> 30:36.600
but no one has told me

30:36.630 --> 30:37.470
where my uncle is.

30:44.300 --> 30:44.830
Yellow!

30:45.090 --> 30:45.890
I'm here!

30:47.340 --> 30:48.290
What are you doing here?

30:49.250 --> 30:50.670
How long have you been following me?

30:51.740 --> 30:53.300
Good boy. You're a good dog.

30:53.620 --> 30:54.060
Let's go.

30:54.540 --> 30:54.980
Go.

30:55.460 --> 30:55.880
This way.

31:35.320 --> 31:37.190
You… You can't

31:37.220 --> 31:38.260
fool me!

31:38.350 --> 31:39.590
I didn't even touch you!

31:46.920 --> 31:48.560
[Identity Unknown]

31:49.980 --> 31:51.180
Is the system

31:51.260 --> 31:52.380
giving me a boyfriend?

31:54.410 --> 31:55.120
I'll pass.

31:59.220 --> 32:00.260
Why did he faint?

32:02.940 --> 32:04.110
Maybe because of low blood sugar.

32:10.420 --> 32:11.610
A strange and mysterious

32:11.640 --> 32:12.350
non-player character.

32:12.950 --> 32:13.950
If I trigger a hidden plot

32:14.300 --> 32:15.880
by saving him,

32:16.060 --> 32:16.940
I'll be in lots of trouble.

32:18.370 --> 32:19.620
I'm on the run now.

32:21.460 --> 32:22.420
Sorry, bro.

32:51.020 --> 32:52.100
You can't be serious!

32:55.310 --> 32:57.420
[Hint: Save the key character.]

32:57.900 --> 32:58.860
Stupid game!

33:06.620 --> 33:10.780
Can you hear me?

33:14.050 --> 33:14.660
Fine.

33:16.700 --> 33:17.540
I've never done this before,

33:19.460 --> 33:20.900
but I know how it works.

33:23.410 --> 33:40.320
[CPR is performed incorrectly here for entertainment purposes. Do not imitate.]

33:42.100 --> 33:43.290
What's wrong with you?

34:02.520 --> 34:03.670
What should I do?

34:03.940 --> 34:05.100
What should I do?

34:09.199 --> 34:10.190
I have to play my ace.

34:11.389 --> 34:11.989
Yellow.

34:20.750 --> 34:21.300
Sorry for offending you.

34:37.219 --> 34:38.170
What are you going to do?

34:45.690 --> 34:46.730
I saved you

34:47.320 --> 34:49.139
yet you want to strangle me!

34:49.300 --> 34:50.100
Is that how you say thank you?

34:55.500 --> 34:57.130
You were trying to save me?

34:57.620 --> 34:58.260
What else could it be?

35:00.210 --> 35:00.770
You don't understand.

35:01.620 --> 35:02.870
Since you're a key character,

35:03.620 --> 35:04.650
you must know how to help me out.

35:07.860 --> 35:08.650
Let me ask you something.

35:09.580 --> 35:10.210
My uncle

35:10.800 --> 35:11.800
wants to sell me for widow burning.

35:12.980 --> 35:13.780
What should I do?

35:14.490 --> 35:15.460
Burning people alive

35:16.260 --> 35:17.200
is the worst atrocity.

35:17.920 --> 35:19.140
According to the law, the persecutor should be executed

35:19.590 --> 35:21.040
and the accomplices should be exiled.

35:21.180 --> 35:22.540
No matter who wants to do that to you,

35:23.200 --> 35:24.310
report it to the government.

35:29.870 --> 35:30.510
I thought

35:30.540 --> 35:31.740
you had a better solution.

35:33.230 --> 35:35.770
I don't have any evidence.

35:35.900 --> 35:37.900
Reporting it to the government can't change anything.

35:40.180 --> 35:40.780
The government

35:40.810 --> 35:41.800
must be looking for me everywhere.

35:42.770 --> 35:43.950
Maybe I should take this opportunity

35:44.650 --> 35:45.290
to change my identity

35:45.940 --> 35:47.190
so that I can find Thirteen as soon as possible.

35:52.180 --> 35:53.250
-Maybe I can help you.
-Can you do me a favor?

35:55.620 --> 35:56.780
What's your plan?

36:04.550 --> 36:05.510
I'm exhausted.

36:06.820 --> 36:07.900
Did you find her?

36:08.610 --> 36:09.490
It's so dark.

36:09.520 --> 36:10.810
Finding her is hard.

36:11.580 --> 36:13.240
There are so many bandits lately.

36:13.580 --> 36:14.860
Could they have kidnapped her?

36:15.460 --> 36:17.460
Maybe. Let's resume looking tomorrow.

36:17.660 --> 36:18.460
You look so tired.

36:18.490 --> 36:19.020
My lower back.

36:20.100 --> 36:20.980
You must be exhausted.

36:21.980 --> 36:23.340
What should we do?

36:24.810 --> 36:25.900
Father, Mother.

36:26.130 --> 36:26.860
Matchmaker Wang

36:26.890 --> 36:28.440
will come to pick her up tomorrow.

36:28.470 --> 36:29.790
No matter what, we must

36:29.820 --> 36:30.940
find Man'er today.

36:35.060 --> 36:35.740
Did you

36:35.740 --> 36:37.590
let that stupid girl go?

36:38.260 --> 36:38.980
Did you do it?

36:42.020 --> 36:43.060
Say something.

36:50.100 --> 36:50.900
Good.

36:51.570 --> 36:53.780
It's really you. What a jinx!

36:54.250 --> 36:55.590
Kneel if you want.

36:56.100 --> 36:56.940
Stay on your knees

36:56.960 --> 36:57.480
until that stupid girl

36:57.770 --> 36:58.410
comes back!

37:18.130 --> 37:18.730
Man'er?

37:19.170 --> 37:20.810
What's all that noise at this ungodly hour?

37:21.480 --> 37:22.320
Lian Man'er?

37:22.910 --> 37:23.660
You didn't escape?

37:24.770 --> 37:25.530
Where can I escape?

37:26.180 --> 37:27.050
I couldn't sleep in the woodshed

37:27.090 --> 37:28.050
so I went to sleep somewhere else.

37:29.540 --> 37:30.460
You're pregnant.

37:30.500 --> 37:31.630
Kneeling is bad for you.

37:31.980 --> 37:32.660
You're making things hard

37:33.050 --> 37:34.400
for Grandma.

37:37.770 --> 37:38.300
Why…

37:39.420 --> 37:39.940
Alright.

37:40.480 --> 37:41.610
She's fine.

37:41.640 --> 37:42.570
We can all be relieved.

37:43.540 --> 37:44.860
Let's all go back in and rest.

37:53.080 --> 37:55.200
You troublemaker.

37:55.980 --> 37:57.380
Sleeping like a dead pig.

37:57.640 --> 37:58.740
You could've let us know!

37:58.740 --> 38:00.180
Mother.

38:00.340 --> 38:01.900
Everyone stayed up late to look for you.

38:02.940 --> 38:03.900
Don't be angry.

38:04.220 --> 38:05.440
Why did you come back?

38:06.050 --> 38:07.220
Don't worry. I'll stay.

38:07.980 --> 38:09.090
I have a better way

38:09.390 --> 38:10.470
to break off the engagement.

38:11.900 --> 38:12.460
Let's go.

38:20.380 --> 38:21.820
You good-for-nothing

38:22.260 --> 38:24.180
lazy bums.

38:24.200 --> 38:26.140
The sun has risen!

38:26.340 --> 38:27.730
Get up!

38:27.980 --> 38:29.310
When I was

38:29.340 --> 38:30.580
a daughter-in-law,

38:30.860 --> 38:32.980
I took good care of everything.

38:33.340 --> 38:34.460
Man'er.

38:34.900 --> 38:35.650
Get up.

38:35.820 --> 38:37.170
Grandma is cursing outside.

38:37.460 --> 38:38.460
Man'er.

38:41.110 --> 38:42.360
Where's my phone?

38:45.410 --> 38:46.350
No phone.

38:46.380 --> 38:47.590
No air conditioner.

38:50.950 --> 38:52.340
This life is unlivable.

38:54.140 --> 38:55.060
What time is it now?

38:55.690 --> 38:56.510
What time?

38:56.780 --> 38:57.540
Nine o'clock.

38:59.490 --> 39:01.500
Six, seven, eight, nine.

39:02.580 --> 39:03.460
Nine o'clock?

39:05.740 --> 39:06.820
He should've been here.

39:07.460 --> 39:08.460
Why hasn't he come?

39:08.580 --> 39:09.900
Coming.

39:10.100 --> 39:11.370
Please come in.

39:11.780 --> 39:12.900
Father, Mother.

39:13.420 --> 39:14.860
The matchmaker is here.

39:15.080 --> 39:16.800
Father, Mother, come out!

39:19.180 --> 39:20.260
I have to put on an act.

39:25.100 --> 39:25.690
Man'er.

39:26.940 --> 39:27.500
Man'er.

39:33.500 --> 39:34.180
Are you sick?

39:34.290 --> 39:35.130
Gentle.

39:36.420 --> 39:36.940
Grandpa.

39:37.940 --> 39:38.500
Grandma.

39:39.650 --> 39:40.570
Sorry.

39:41.260 --> 39:43.130
I caught a cold a few days ago.

39:43.900 --> 39:45.940
I thought I'd recover in a few days.

39:47.660 --> 39:48.370
I didn't expect it

39:48.900 --> 39:49.940
to get so much worse.

39:50.980 --> 39:52.370
I'm afraid

39:52.940 --> 39:54.100
I can't marry into the Sun family.

39:59.600 --> 40:01.380
It's just an ailment.

40:01.580 --> 40:02.470
You'll be fine.

40:02.830 --> 40:03.870
After you get married,

40:04.140 --> 40:04.960
the Sun family will surely

40:04.980 --> 40:06.980
send for the best physician to treat you.

40:07.320 --> 40:08.430
Maybe the next day,

40:08.460 --> 40:10.260
you'll fully recover.

40:15.610 --> 40:16.930
That will be great.

40:18.340 --> 40:18.980
However,

40:19.620 --> 40:20.460
if I didn't recover,

40:20.990 --> 40:22.080
the Sun family would think

40:22.580 --> 40:23.420
the Lian family

40:23.810 --> 40:25.340
marry a sickly daughter to them.

40:26.140 --> 40:26.770
That

40:27.260 --> 40:29.340
would not only bring shame to our family

40:30.240 --> 40:32.320
but also ruin Uncle Shouren's reputation.

40:36.580 --> 40:37.700
Man'er is right.

40:38.500 --> 40:40.260
Now that she's seriously ill,

40:40.620 --> 40:41.580
marrying her off

40:41.620 --> 40:42.940
can wait.

40:43.620 --> 40:44.380
Father.

40:44.520 --> 40:45.160
Father.

40:46.400 --> 40:47.770
I think

40:48.130 --> 40:49.010
if Man'er

40:49.190 --> 40:50.380
stays at home,

40:50.760 --> 40:51.980
we can only

40:52.000 --> 40:53.880
find a physician for her.

40:54.110 --> 40:55.030
We'll have to

40:55.060 --> 40:55.900
leave the rest to God.

40:56.490 --> 40:58.060
The Sun family is rich.

40:58.340 --> 40:59.380
If she marries into the Sun family,

40:59.750 --> 41:01.510
she'll surely be taken better care of.

41:04.420 --> 41:04.940
Man'er.

41:05.620 --> 41:06.210
Man'er.

41:07.060 --> 41:07.780
Man'er.

41:08.300 --> 41:10.260
The Sun family lives so far from our village.

41:10.720 --> 41:12.020
Man'er is too ill

41:12.460 --> 41:13.900
to travel that far.

41:14.340 --> 41:15.350
All country people

41:15.380 --> 41:17.140
get sick sometimes.

41:17.820 --> 41:18.940
She's not that fragile.

41:20.040 --> 41:21.040
Grandma is right.

41:22.180 --> 41:23.500
I'm not that fragile.

41:26.130 --> 41:26.740
Grandpa,

41:27.780 --> 41:28.980
a deal is a deal.

41:29.780 --> 41:30.740
No matter what happens,

41:31.660 --> 41:32.580
I have to go.

41:34.230 --> 41:35.700
I may die halfway,

41:36.820 --> 41:38.700
but it'll be my fate.

41:40.030 --> 41:40.620
I'm afraid

41:41.890 --> 41:43.210
that after I leave,

41:45.780 --> 41:47.180
I can't

41:48.860 --> 41:50.940
come back to see you again.

41:53.390 --> 41:54.870
Grandpa.

41:59.940 --> 42:00.580
Man'er.

42:02.460 --> 42:03.100
Man'er!

42:10.900 --> 42:11.980
In that case,

42:14.180 --> 42:15.380
let's do as Shouren says.

42:19.100 --> 42:20.400
Okay.

42:20.530 --> 42:21.550
Hurry up.

42:22.100 --> 42:24.500
Let's go. Wait. Wait.

42:24.920 --> 42:25.930
I have something to say.

42:25.950 --> 42:26.700
I'm not done yet.

42:26.890 --> 42:28.130
Wait.

42:28.460 --> 42:29.460
I'm not done yet.

42:29.480 --> 42:30.180
I'm not done yet.

42:30.200 --> 42:31.210
She's not feeling well.

42:31.560 --> 42:32.170
Man'er.

42:34.580 --> 42:35.550
Is Lian Man'er home?

42:44.580 --> 42:46.260
I guess you're Man'er's grandpa.

42:46.980 --> 42:47.820
Nice to meet you.

42:49.060 --> 42:50.140
You are...

42:52.720 --> 42:53.790
Lian Man'er's husband.

42:54.840 --> 42:55.740
This child's

42:56.340 --> 42:56.740
father.

43:16.100 --> 43:16.850
Is Man'er

43:18.780 --> 43:19.870
really this child's mother?

43:20.020 --> 43:20.820
Impossible.

43:21.280 --> 43:22.730
Man'er seldom goes out.

43:23.180 --> 43:24.570
How could she possibly have a child?

43:25.500 --> 43:26.980
Where are you from?

43:27.340 --> 43:28.060
You're

43:28.080 --> 43:29.680
throwing mud at the Lian family!

43:31.100 --> 43:32.860
I'm from the Shen Village, Qingshan County.

43:33.280 --> 43:34.480
Three years ago, I left for Lotus Town

43:34.620 --> 43:35.620
with my father and brother.

43:36.580 --> 43:37.820
When I passed here,

43:38.180 --> 43:39.580
I and Man'er fell in love with each other at first sight.

43:40.420 --> 43:41.780
She often ran out to meet me

43:42.420 --> 43:43.580
and soon

43:44.020 --> 43:44.900
got pregnant.

43:45.720 --> 43:46.840
Shen Nuo.

43:47.970 --> 43:49.510
- Man'er.
-You finally came.

43:51.260 --> 43:52.330
Why do you look so pale?

43:53.020 --> 43:53.900
It's all your fault.

43:54.540 --> 43:55.270
You're late!

43:55.290 --> 43:56.180
What took you so long?

43:56.860 --> 43:57.380
Look.

43:58.390 --> 43:59.760
I brought our child with me.

44:00.660 --> 44:01.100
Look.

44:01.580 --> 44:02.300
Our

44:04.070 --> 44:04.930
child?

44:07.410 --> 44:13.020
[Mission: Earn 1,000 teals of gold which equals to 10,000 teals of silver]

44:07.410 --> 44:13.020
[Income: 0]

44:07.410 --> 44:13.020
[Expenses: 0]
